Subject: [PATCH v1 0/5] media: i2c: add Galaxycore GC5035 sensor driver
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Bring in Tomasz Figa's GC5035 driver (v4), add OTP handling, modernise
it and add Samsung Galaxy A52 4G (a52q) depth/macro camera support.
Original authorship of the imported patches is preserved.

Based on v7.3-rc5. Not independently tested on hardware by the
submitter tooling; on-device verification pending.

Hao He (2):
  media: i2c: Add a driver for the Galaxycore GC5035 sensor
  media: i2c: gc5035: Add OTP configuration handling

Miroslav Mráz (2):
  dt-bindings: media: gc5035: use mclk clock-name and add label
  media: i2c: gc5035: modernise and add Galaxy A52 (a52q) support

Tomasz Figa (1):
  media: dt-bindings: media: i2c: Add bindings for GC5035

